- type: s3fs
  label: 1000 Genomes
  id: 1000genomes
  doc: Access to the 1000 Genomes Project with human genetic variation, including SNPs, structural variants, and their haplotype context.
  bucket: 1000genomes
  anon: true
  listings_expiry_time: 60

- type: s3fs
  label: 4D Nucleome (4DN)
  id: 4dn-open-data-public
  doc: Released and archived 4D Nucleome data (Hi-C, imaging, and other nuclear organization assays). Files are keyed by portal UUID and accession; see https://data.4dnucleome.org for metadata.
  bucket: 4dn-open-data-public
  anon: true

- type: s3fs
  label: Somatic Mosaicism across Human Tissues (SMaHT)
  id: smaht-open-data-public
  doc: SMaHT open-access data, including aligned WGS and RNA-Seq reads and variants from benchmarking cell lines. Files are keyed by portal UUID and accession; see https://data.smaht.org for metadata.
  bucket: smaht-open-data-public
  anon: true

- type: s3fs
  label: Human Microbiome Project (HMP)
  id: human-microbiome-project
  doc: Human Microbiome Project sequencing data and reference genomes from the NIH Common Fund.
  bucket: human-microbiome-project
  anon: true

- type: s3fs
  label: SPARC
  id: sparc-public
  doc: SPARC public datasets bridging the body and the brain. Top-level folders are SPARC dataset IDs; see https://sparc.science for metadata.
  bucket: sparc-prod-aod-discover-publish50-use1
  anon: true

- type: s3fs
  label: NIH Roadmap Epigenomics
  id: roadmapepigenomics
  doc: Released and archived NIH Roadmap Epigenomics data, including uniformly processed hg19 tracks.
  bucket: roadmapepigenomics
  anon: true
